573
00:22:21.170 --> 00:22:22.850
I swear to you that we will be

574
00:22:22.850 --> 00:22:23.190
happy.

575
00:22:23.850 --> 00:22:25.930
I will make sure of it, but right

576
00:22:25.930 --> 00:22:26.930
