589
00:22:52.610 --> 00:22:54.590
I want you to be free to choose.

590
00:22:55.690 --> 00:22:57.590
That was what he said to me, and

591
00:22:57.590 --> 00:22:59.910
the very next day he left for Moscow.

592
00:23:00.650 --> 00:23:02.590
We agreed between us not to say a

593
00:23:02.590 --> 00:23:03.410
