594
00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:07.490
That was his idea, his wish, and so

595
00:23:07.490 --> 00:23:09.710
the matter was left as it was.

596
00:23:10.630 --> 00:23:13.670
Well, she continued, her voice softening with a

597
00:23:13.670 --> 00:23:16.890
mixture of sadness and resignation, that's almost the

598
00:23:16.890 --> 00:23:17.750
end of my story.

599
00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:20.070
A whole year has passed now.

600
00:23:20.650 --> 00:23:21.450
