611
00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:48.490
There's been no sign, no word from him.

612
00:23:49.710 --> 00:23:52.030
She stopped there, as though the weight of

613
00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:54.090
her emotions had become too much to bear.

614
00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:57.170
For a moment she sat still, her head

615
00:23:57.170 --> 00:23:57.690
