634
00:24:40.570 --> 00:24:42.710
We made an agreement that evening before he

635
00:24:42.710 --> 00:24:43.010
left.

636
00:24:43.790 --> 00:24:45.010
We agreed on everything.

637
00:24:45.870 --> 00:24:48.870
We came here, to this very embankment, after

638
00:24:48.870 --> 00:24:49.870
we talked that night.

639
00:24:50.490 --> 00:24:52.430
It was ten o'clock, and we sat

640
00:24:52.430 --> 00:24:53.070
on this bench.

641
