744
00:28:46.630 --> 00:28:47.210
you are here?

745
00:28:47.950 --> 00:28:50.770
If by any chance your feelings have changed,

746
00:28:51.270 --> 00:28:53.490
this letter is not to reproach you or

747
00:28:53.490 --> 00:28:54.070
to plead.

748
00:28:54.750 --> 00:28:56.370
It is only to tell you that I

749
00:28:56.370 --> 00:28:58.690
do not hold you responsible, nor do I

750
00:28:58.690 --> 00:28:59.230
