754
00:29:05.330 --> 00:29:07.830
I know you to be an honorable man.

755
00:29:07.830 --> 00:29:10.450
You will not ridicule or grow angry over

756
00:29:10.450 --> 00:29:13.210
these lines, written in such haste and emotion.

757
00:29:14.310 --> 00:29:16.610
Please remember that they come from a poor

758
00:29:16.610 --> 00:29:20.410
girl who is entirely alone, who has no

759
00:29:20.410 --> 00:29:22.930
one to guide her or advise her, and

760
00:29:22.930 --> 00:29:25.110
who has always struggled to control her heart.

761
00:29:26.010 --> 00:29:27.730
If a shadow of doubt has crept into

762
00:29:27.730 --> 00:29:29.490
my heart, forgive me for it.

763
00:29:30.190 --> 00:29:32.150
I know you are not capable of offending,

764
00:29:32.470 --> 00:29:34.890
even in thought, someone who has loved you

765
00:29:34.890 --> 00:29:37.290
so deeply and continues to love you still.

766
00:29:38.190 --> 00:29:39.950
